>> >> > I have also loaded a set of preprocessed Hapmap samples as follows:
>>
>> >> > ds <- AromaUnitTotalCnBinarySet$byName("SNP6_HAPMAP_FEMALE",
>> >> > tags="ACC,ra,-XY,BPN,-XY,AVG,A+B,FLN,-XY",
>> >> > chipType="GenomeWideSNP_6");
>> >> > print(ds);
